From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:40:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 20/21] arm64: dts: rockchip: add an overlay for the other
 Ulanzi D200 panel

Some Ulanzi D200 units have a different 720x1280 panel. It reports the
same NV3052C ID as the one in rk3308-ulanzi-d200.dts, but needs other
porches (hfp 46, hbp 36, hsync 10, vfp 30, vbp 14, vsync 2) and another
init sequence (power, gamma and gate timing). With the wrong config the
picture is wavy and stretched.

Add that panel's config as an overlay on the panel node, for the
bootloader to apply on those units.

Signed-off-by: Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
---
 .../rockchip/rk3308-ulanzi-d200-panel-h3.dtso | 99 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 99 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 dts/upstream/src/arm64/rockchip/rk3308-ulanzi-d200-panel-h3.dtso

diff --git a/dts/upstream/src/arm64/rockchip/rk3308-ulanzi-d200-panel-h3.dtso b/dts/upstream/src/arm64/rockchip/rk3308-ulanzi-d200-panel-h3.dtso
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..ad7a66af
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dts/upstream/src/arm64/rockchip/rk3308-ulanzi-d200-panel-h3.dtso
@@ -0,0 +1,99 @@
